OL,3,GNEWSAGirl killed in crash as she walked
OL,4,Ato school named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old girl who was killed in a
OL,7,Fcrash as she made her way to Highgate
OL,8,FSchool in north London has been named
OL,9,Fas Melissa Premaratne.
OL,11,FThe Metropolitan Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called to North Road, Highgate, at
OL,13,Fabout 08:15 BST on Thursday, following
OL,14,Freports of a crash involving a
OL,15,Fpedestrian and car.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
