OL,3,GNEWSAGirl killed in crash as she walked
OL,4,Ato school named
OL,5,
OL,6,FMelissa, a Year 12 pupil, was
OL,7,Fpronounced dead at the scene, near the
OL,8,Fprivate school's main site. The driver
OL,9,Fof the car, a 68-year-old man, remained
OL,10,Fat the scene and was arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,12,Fdriving.
OL,14,FHer family described her as "a light in
OL,15,Four lives and an amazing person".
